 "address_zh": "新疆维吾尔自治区阿克苏区地区的温宿县",
 "address_en": "Wensu County, Aksu District, Xinjiang Uygur Autonomous Region",
 "address_en_source": "machine_translation",
 "category": "desert",
 "category_zh": "草原沙漠",
 "category_en": "Grassland & desert",
 "intro_zh": "自然风光壮美奇绝的阿克苏地区既有天山第一峰——托木尔峰，世界第二大流动性沙漠——塔克拉玛干大沙漠，全国最长的内陆河——塔里木河，世界面积最大、保存最完整的原始胡杨森林，国家级自然保护区——托木尔峰自然保护区，又有雅丹地貌、温宿大峡谷、天山神木园等自然景区，自然风光集新疆南北疆之大成。",
 "intro_en": "The Aksu region, with its magnificent natural scenery, has the highest peak in the Tianshan Mountains - Tomur Peak; the world's second largest mobile desert - the Taklamakan Desert; the country's longest inland river - the Tarim River; the world's largest and best-preserved primitive Populus euphratica forest; the national nature reserve - Tomur Peak Nature Reserve; and natural scenic spots such as the Yadan Landform, Wensu Grand Canyon, and the Tianshan Sacred Wood Garden. The natural scenery embodies the culmination of northern and southern Xinjiang.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
